### 3.1 Sign Up Admin (by default admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin1234",
    "name": "Administrator",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "role_id": "ADMIN"
}

### 3.1 Sign Up Shopper
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "shopper1",
    "password": "pass1234",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "role_id": "SHOPPER"
}

### 3.2 Sign In
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin1234"
}

### 3.3 Update User Data
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/user/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACTUAL_AUTH_TOKEN

{
    "name": "Updated Name",
    "email": "updated@example.com",
    "newPassword": "newpass1234",
    "currentPassword": "admin1234"
}

### 3.4 Shop Creation (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/shops
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "name": "My Shop",
    "description": "Shop description",
    "salesperson_id": "salesperson_user_id"
}

### 3.5 Product Creation (Salesperson only)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "name": "Product Name",
    "description": "Product description",
    "price": 29.99,
    "stock": 100
}

### 3.5 Product Update
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "name": "Updated Product Name",
    "description": "Updated description",
    "price": 39.99,
    "stock": 150
}

### 3.5 Product Deletion
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.5 List Salesperson Shops
GET http://localhost:3000/api/salesperson/shops
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.6 List All Shops (Shopper)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.6 Place Order (Shopper)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "products": [
        {
            "product_id": "product_id_1",
            "quantity": 2
        },
        {
            "product_id": "product_id_2",
            "quantity": 1
        }
    ]
}

### 3.6 List Shopper Orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shopper/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.7 List Shop Orders (Salesperson)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.7 Update Order Status (Salesperson)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/shops/{{shopId}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "status": "PROCESSING" // Possible values: PENDING, PROCESSING, COMPLETED, CANCELLED
}